	"Description": "This mod provides a configurable key-binded way to decraft/uncraft any SMAPI-registered craftable item.\n<br />\n<br />This tweak works after pressing a group of keys (default only space) which can be edited from the mod's \"config.json\" file that is created once launching SMAPI with this mod on while selecting the item to be decrafting in your hotbar.\n<br />\n<br />Added support for multiple binds and for SDV 1.4/SMAPI v3.\n<br />\n<br />Source code available at [url=https://github.com/iSkLz/DecraftingMod]GitHub[/url].",
